==Battleground==
*2 [[Baa Baa]]s (500%) spawn, delay 5~8.33 seconds<sup>150f~250f</sup>.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s (500%) spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*4 [[Baa Baa]]s (500%) spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Baa Baa]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Zory]] spawns.
**5 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to easily beat this simple stage. Even if the Zombie enemies are at a low magnification, they are more threatening than they appear to be, so make sure to bring any [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Anti-Zombie Cats]] as well as any [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer Cats]] to deal with them.

